cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package or the parameter database, cite it as below."
title: "lesusa: Stone-Geary (LES) parameter database for the United States with exact aggregation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Simonato
    given-names: Thiago
    email: thiago.c.simonato@gmail.com
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tsimonato/lesusa"
abstract: >-
  Theoretically consistent Linear Expenditure System (Stone-Geary)
  parameters for the United States, 2017-2019, on a 51 state x 10 income
  decile x 5 age grid over 42 goods (release cut
  frisch_friedman_v1.4.0-tier2), with one aggregation function that is
  exact at the base point and re-derives elasticities from closed forms.
